[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3306786089","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110650#issuecomment-3306786089","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110650","id":3306786089,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FGY0p","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T10:51:04Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T11:16:33Z","body":"Script used for benchmark:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nclass_name Control\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar node: Control = Control.new()\r\n\tvar internal_count:= 20000\r\n\tvar count: int = 20000\r\n\r\n\tfor i in internal_count:\r\n\t\tnode.add_child(Control.new(), false, Node.INTERNAL_MODE_FRONT)\r\n\r\n\tfor i in count:\r\n\t\tnode.add_child(Control.new())\r\n\r\n\tfor i in internal_count:\r\n\t\tnode.add_child(Control.new(), false, Node.INTERNAL_MODE_BACK)\r\n\r\n\tvar time = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tnode.get_children(true)\r\n\tprints(Time.get_ticks_msec() - time, \"ms\")\r\n\r\n\ttime = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tnode.get_children(true)\r\n\tprints(Time.get_ticks_msec() - time, \"ms\")\r\n\r\n\tnode.queue_free()\r\n\r\n```\r\nBefore: (First call updates the cache)\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\nBefore: 47 ms\r\nBefore: 20 ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter: Since children are added in order (Front, External, Back) it doesn't require updating the cache.\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\nAfter: 18 ms\r\nAfter: 16 ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis improves performance for the most common use of adding children `add_child(node)` where most of the time `Back` children are empty. The benchmark should also show faster results when you exclude adding the internal children above.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3306786089/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308294974","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110650#issuecomment-3308294974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110650","id":3308294974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FMJM-","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T16:00:16Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T16:00:35Z","body":"> There is one potential caveat which is that adding children while updating the cache alongside will be slightly more expensive (because of growth allocations), but I think this is acceptable since we expect children to be queried far more often than added.\r\n\r\nWe can catch this when it happens and prevent it by adding a debug `mutable bool updating_cache = false;` and an error when it tries to update the cache while it's already updating to know the cases that may invalidate the cache, currently i have found that there are some cases that aren't thread guarded and may cause issues `Node::is_greater_than`, `Node::_get_tree_string_pretty`, `Node::_get_tree_string` and `SceneTreeFTI::_update_dirty_nodes`.\r\n\r\n> In any case, the same trade-off was made when originally writing the code, just with fewer cases.\r\n\r\nYes i also have realized that there was a single special case already for adding ordinary children but it wasn't applied for newly added nodes since the cache was marked dirty by default.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308294974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315991041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110650#issuecomment-3315991041","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110650","id":3315991041,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FpgIB","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T13:18:01Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T13:18:01Z","body":"> Looks good to me. The logic is sound. But I'd like to see @lawnjelly review this too; I think he's been working with the children cache more.\r\n\r\nI'm not super expert on the children cache in 4.x (I work mainly with 3.x which doesn't have this), but the PR looks fine from a quick look, assuming initializing `dirty` to false is okay (it depends how it is initially populated, sometimes there are shortcuts for loading, so there is just a possibility of regressions there worth checking).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315991041/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316001210","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110650#issuecomment-3316001210","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110650","id":3316001210,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fpim6","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T13:37:08Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T13:37:08Z","body":"> I'm not super expert on the children cache in 4.x (I work mainly with 3.x which doesn't have this), but the PR looks fine from a quick look, assuming initializing `dirty` to false is okay (it depends how it is initially populated, sometimes there are shortcuts for loading, so there is just a possibility of regressions there worth checking).\r\n\r\nThe cache is only marked dirty when children are added, removed, or moved. So initializing it to false is safe by default, those operations will properly detect and update the dirty state when needed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316001210/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3398477504","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110650#issuecomment-3398477504","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110650","id":3398477504,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KkKbA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-13T17:37:18Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T17:37:18Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3398477504/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]